5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to know if past projects actually worked for the people using them.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about how long rooms stay out of service during construction.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The calendar keeps slipping. I want to see why schedules fail.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I am worried the final costs never match the approved paper figures.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The same few staff are carrying all the routine upkeep. It is unsustainable.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Victoria, do you have data on how long rooms are closed?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Yes, I am looking into the timetable records for rooms out of service.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the delivery schedules to see which projects slip.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I want to look at the tender records to see cost trends.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I am checking the staffing posts to see who is left holding the bag.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will look at the post-occupancy review ratings to see what users think.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I also want to see the booking data to understand actual usage.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also check the weather days in the site diaries.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will also look at the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will also check the bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,It is important to see if the space is actually used after opening.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,Agreed. Usage data will tell us if the investment was worth it.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Weather delays are a major factor in schedule slippage.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"If we do not reserve for renewal, the costs will explode later.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"If the technicians are doing manual work, the equipment is failing.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
