35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The data shows general rooms are always full, but specialist ones are idle.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, that confirms my suspicion. We are building the wrong things.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"My findings show comfort projects slip, but safety ones do not.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"I found that mechanical costs are rising, but we have no reserve for old AV gear.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,I found that technicians are doing manual checks because the extraction is broken.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"So, a general-purpose space would be used, but a specialist one would not.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"Exactly. The booking data is clear. We need general space, not niche labs.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"If we choose a project for comfort, it will likely be late.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, that is worrying. But the cost of ventilation is also rising.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,The ventilation upgrade is urgent because the current system is failing.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"But if the ventilation upgrade is for a single wing, it might not be used well.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, that is a risk. But the safety issue is critical.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The weather data suggests outdoor work is risky. Indoor work is safer for schedules.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,The lack of a renewal reserve means we will pay more later for any equipment.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The staffing data shows we have no one to maintain new complex systems.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,I am leaning towards a general space that everyone can use.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I agree. The booking data supports a general-purpose solution.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I am concerned about the schedule, but indoor work is better.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"I am worried about the long-term costs, but we must act now.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I am worried about the maintenance burden, but the current system is failing.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
