60,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,Option A fits the booking data perfectly. General space is what is needed.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, yes. Option A is a conversion, so it should be faster and cheaper.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option A is indoor work, so it avoids the weather delays I found.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Option A has less complex equipment, so the renewal reserve issue is smaller.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option A is simpler to maintain than a new lab or media center.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
