66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,Agreed. Option B would likely be underused based on the booking trends.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Option B is also indoor, but the demand is not there.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"Option B has expensive AV gear, which we have no reserve for.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Option B would require more technical staff, which we do not have.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,Option C is outdoor work. The weather data says that is risky.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, correct. Option C would likely be delayed by rain and frost.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Option C is also a comfort project, which tends to slip.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Kenji,,"Option C has lower mechanical costs, but the schedule risk is high.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Option C requires grounds staff, which are unfilled due to the hiring freeze.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Option D is urgent, but it is for a single wing. The reviews say those are least liked.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, that is a valid point. But the safety issue is real.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Option D is indoor, but it is a complex mechanical job. Costs are rising.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Kenji,,Option D has the highest mechanical cost increase. And no reserve for the old gear.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,Option D would require the technicians to do even more manual work if the new system fails.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
